[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:79. Carol's Shopping List]
[00:00.780] Lesson 79. | 第79课
[00:03.545] What are you doing, Peggy? | 佩吉，你在做什么？
[00:06.220] I'm making a shopping list, Tom. | 我在列购物清单，汤姆。
[00:09.290] What do we need? | 我们需要什么？
[00:11.230] We need a lot of things this week. | 我们这周需要很多东西。
[00:14.605] I must go to the grocer's. | 我必须去食品店。
[00:17.940] We haven't got much tea or coffee. | 我们没有多少茶或咖啡了。
[00:20.930] And we haven't got any sugar or jam. | 而且我们也没有糖或果酱了。
[00:24.200] What about vegetables? | 蔬菜呢？
[00:26.490] I must go to the greengrocer's. | 我必须去蔬菜店。
[00:29.595] We haven't got many tomatoes. | 我们没有多少西红柿了。
[00:32.210] But we've got a lot of potatoes. | 但我们有很多土豆。
[00:35.720] I must go to the butcher's too. | 我也必须去肉店。
[00:39.610] We need some meat. | 我们需要些肉。
[00:41.610] We haven't got any meat at all. | 我们一点肉都没有了。
[00:44.730] Have we got any beer and wine? | 我们有啤酒和葡萄酒吗？
[00:47.795] No, we haven't. | 不，我们没有。
[00:49.840] And I'm not going to get any. | 我也不打算去买。
[00:53.030] I hope that you've got some money. | 我希望你带了钱。
[00:55.800] I haven't got much. | 我没有多少钱。
[00:57.750] Well, I haven't got much either. | 嗯，我也没有多少钱。